/docs/*
!/docs/figures/
/fig/
prehop_paper*
/*.pdf
/*.pptx
/*.zip
/*.csv

# Markdown: only the public guides
*.md
!/README.md
!/docs/METHOD.md
!/docs/SETUP.md
!/docs/REPRODUCING.md

